    {
      "id": 1312,
      "before_sha256": "004ff0d7620fe8c2a82f9446c6fded95f55909016dcf0d61a07d958fd640bd9e",
      "reason": "原C叙述“可请求最多四个”可能成立，无法作为唯一错误选项；限定IOS并改为明确错误的固定四个。",
      "updates": {
        "prompt": "A Cisco IOS device is configured as a DHCPv4 server. Which two statements describe supported DHCP functions? (Choose two.)",
        "options": [
          {
            "label": "A",
            "text": "The DHCP server always grants infinite leases and never requires renewal."
          },
          {
            "label": "B",
            "text": "The DHCP server leases client IP addresses dynamically."
          },
          {
            "label": "C",
            "text": "The DHCP client must always receive exactly four DNS server addresses."
          },
          {
            "label": "D",
            "text": "The DHCP server offers the ability to exclude specific IP addresses from a pool of IP addresses."
          },
          {
            "label": "E",
            "text": "The DHCP client maintains a pool of IP addresses it is able to assign."
          }
        ],
        "explanation": "B、D。Cisco IOS DHCP 服务器可以动态租出 IPv4 地址，并可使用 `ip dhcp excluded-address` 将指定地址排除在动态分配之外。A 错在 always：有限租约需要续租，也可以配置无限租约。C 错在必须恰好四个：DHCP DNS 服务器选项是地址列表，数量取决于配置与实现，并无这样的统一要求。E 混淆客户端与服务端：客户端不维护服务器的可分配地址池。排除固定地址有助于避免冲突，但不能消除其他错误配置造成的冲突。"
      }
    }
  ],
